    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① 首尾帧与锁定原音频",
      "pos": [
        0,
        2160
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "color": "#2d3f66",
      "bgcolor": "#111827",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": "## FL2VA 使用方法\n\n1. 分别替换首帧、尾帧和源音频；保持 `task_type=FL2VA`、`audio_mode=lock_source`。\n2. `<Picture 1>` 是首帧，`<Picture 2>` 是尾帧。局部事件写动作，人物、场景、风格和持续声音写全局提示词。\n3. 最终保存节点的音频必须来自 Conditioning 的 `mux_audio`；不要改接 AV Decode 的生成音频，否则就不再是锁定原音轨。\n4. `lock_source` 不能和 `joint_av_exp` 混用；本例使用论文范围的 `video_only_paper`。\n\n`Prompt Relay Preview`已串在Plan与Conditioning之间：它只验证哈希、17n+5、24fps、覆盖/重叠和事件帧段，不加载H3模型、不执行采样；看到READY后再继续。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② 模型顺序与参数",
      "pos": [
        960,
        2160
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 17,
      "mode": 0,
      "color": "#2d3f66",
      "bgcolor": "#111827",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": "## 唯一允许的模型顺序\n\n`完整 FL2VA UNET → Prompt Relay Conditioning → corrected Alpha8 Bypass LoRA → DualClock 8步`。\n\n不要把 LoRA 接在 Prompt Relay 前面；节点会拒绝已有 weight patch / bypass injection。LoRA 固定为 `minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_alpha8-T8-convert.safetensors`，强度1.0；视频/音频 shift 为12/3。`query_chunk_rows=256`是显存与速度折中，不会创建完整S×S mask。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ 已验证范围",
      "pos": [
